<title>UK: Victoria Wine says Dec sales up 8 pct.</title>
<headline>Victoria Wine says Dec sales up 8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>British wine retailer Victoria Wine said on Friday liquor takings rose eight percent in December 1996 from the year-earlier month.</p>
<p>Victoria Wine said turnover at its branches, now numbering more than 1,550, exceeded all previous performances. On Christmas Eve, takings totalled nine million pounds.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
